We are looking for a Test Automation to join an automation testing team, helping to ensure the quality and reliability of applications throughout the development lifecycle. The role involves analysing business requirements, translating them into technical specifications and building automated testing solutions, with a strong focus on Java, Cucumber, Selenium, Appium and load testing. 
What will you do?

Analyse business requirements and translate them into technical specifications;

Design, implement and maintain automated test frameworks within an automation testing team;

Develop and execute interface, API, load, integrated and mobile tests;

Identify the most critical business scenarios and automate them with a critical view of the business;

Build careful, well-structured test scenarios with a view to product quality;

Integrate AI into the testing environment as an accelerator of development and error detection;

Support development teams in complex technical implementations;

Support project delivery throughout the development lifecycle.

What are we looking for?

Bachelor's or Master's Degree in Computer Engineering or related areas;

Minimum 4 years of experience in automated testing analysis and development;

Expert level of experience in the role, with mastery of Java and Cucumber;

Experience with Selenium and Appium frameworks;

Experience with JMeter and Locust;

Mastery of load testing;

Experience with cloud-based applications;

